<title>USA: GM April US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>GM April US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp</p>
<p>			Apr 1-30, 1997     Apr 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Total Car		236,562	   270,752	    -12.6</p>
<p> Total Truck	    181,611	   170,502	     +6.5</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Apr 30, 1997 Jan 1-Apr 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Total Car		875,515	   931,833	     -5.1</p>
<p> Total Truck	    665,580	   661,554	     +1.6</p>
<p>NOTES - Results include sales from Saab of 1,901 and 2,105 in April 1997 and 1996, respectively, and 7,505 and 7,701 in the 1997 and 1996 year-to-date periods. Saab is a joint venture of GM and Investor AB.</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26,  102 for year to date vs 103 in year ago.</p>
</text>
